        "biography": "Jacky Pang is a film producer from the Republic of China who is best known for her collaborations with Wong Kar-Wai. She began her career as the production manager of Wong Kar-Wai\u2019s Chungking Express in 1993 before moving into producing with Ashes of Time and Fallen Angels for Kar-Wai that each won awards at festivals across China and the world. Jacky followed this by also producing his English-language debut My Blueberry Nights, the short film Eros, and The Grandmaster, which won Zhang Ziyi an APSA Award for Best Performance by an Actress. In 2019, Pang received her first APSA nominated for Best Feature Film as producer of Balloon for director Pema Tseden.",
